										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Good Late Evening Canadian LEGO Fans! <a href="https://www.amazon.ca/Best-Sellers-Toys-Games-Building-Construction/zgbs/toys/6303772011/ref=zg_bs_nav_toys_1_toys?&amp;_encoding=UTF8&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkCode=ur2&amp;linkId=b2b40c2932de313d6407b37fba062f11&amp;camp=15121&amp;creative=330641" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.amazon.ca/Best-Sellers-Toys-Games-Building-Construction/zgbs/toys/6303772011/ref=zg_bs_nav_toys_1_toys?&amp;_encoding=UTF8&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkCode=ur2&amp;linkId=b2b40c2932de313d6407b37fba062f11&amp;camp=15121&amp;creative=330641">Amazon Canada</a> has lots of incredible LEGO deals for this evening. Don&#8217;t miss out as there&#8217;s a lot of great sets at a great price! Free shipping on orders above $35 CAD.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-102141 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/18-LEGO-ART-31218-Japanese-Cherry-Blossom-Landscape-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="873" height="876" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/18-LEGO-ART-31218-Japanese-Cherry-Blossom-Landscape-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 873w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/18-LEGO-ART-31218-Japanese-Cherry-Blossom-Landscape-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x300.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/18-LEGO-ART-31218-Japanese-Cherry-Blossom-Landscape-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-150x150.jpg 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/18-LEGO-ART-31218-Japanese-Cherry-Blossom-Landscape-January-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x771.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 873px) 100vw, 873px" /></p>
<p>My top picks include the <a href="https://www.amazon.ca/LEGO-Gingerbread-Christmas-Brick-Built-Decoration/dp/B0G2STSGW3?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkId=116f4105c1437d08fb9568178dab219a&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Star Wars Gingerbread AT-AT Walker 40806</a> at 25% off for <strong>$59.99</strong> (reg.$79.99), <a href="https://www.amazon.ca/LEGO-Japanese-Blossom-Landscape-Building/dp/B0FMSD38WR?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkId=f6d4788cb00c34ef66a5dc629bef3e5e&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">18+ LEGO Art Japanese Cherry Blossom Landscape 31218</a> at 21% off for<strong> $143</strong> (reg.$179.99) and <a href="https://www.amazon.ca/LEGO-NINJAGO-Twin-Titan-Mechs/dp/B0G2T2HZQT?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkId=ba8613f97e1c12cc1bba4a4f9a1b058c&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO NINJAGO The Twin Titan Mechs 71870</a> at 20% off for <strong>$159.99</strong> (reg.$199.99).</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-108493 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Ninjago-71870-The-Twin-Titan-Mechs-August-2026-Lifestyle-2.jpg" alt="" width="1212" height="808" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Ninjago-71870-The-Twin-Titan-Mechs-August-2026-Lifestyle-2.jpg 1800w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Ninjago-71870-The-Twin-Titan-Mechs-August-2026-Lifestyle-2-300x200.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Ninjago-71870-The-Twin-Titan-Mechs-August-2026-Lifestyle-2-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Ninjago-71870-The-Twin-Titan-Mechs-August-2026-Lifestyle-2-768x512.jpg 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Ninjago-71870-The-Twin-Titan-Mechs-August-2026-Lifestyle-2-1536x1024.jpg 1536w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1212px) 100vw, 1212px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-99915 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/LEGO-Star-Wars-40806-Gingerbread-AT-AT-Walker-October-2025-Release-Date-Christmas-2025-Set-Lifestyle-22.jpg" alt="" width="992" height="634" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/LEGO-Star-Wars-40806-Gingerbread-AT-AT-Walker-October-2025-Release-Date-Christmas-2025-Set-Lifestyle-22.jpg 992w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/LEGO-Star-Wars-40806-Gingerbread-AT-AT-Walker-October-2025-Release-Date-Christmas-2025-Set-Lifestyle-22-300x192.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/LEGO-Star-Wars-40806-Gingerbread-AT-AT-Walker-October-2025-Release-Date-Christmas-2025-Set-Lifestyle-22-768x491.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 992px) 100vw, 992px" /></p>
<p>Below are 18 of our Handpicked Best Amazon Canada LEGO Deals &amp; Sales List for Tonight, November 10, 2026.</p>
<p>Be sure to subscribe to our email list so you don&#8217;t miss out on any LEGO Deals &amp; News!</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates. For those that prefer real time LEGO Deals &amp; News push mobile device notifications, we have the <a href="https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VbDxgTZ6BIEptg6nJX0p" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Toys N Bricks Whatsapp Channel</a> and the <a href="https://discord.com/channels/1399932842276028519/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener">Toys N Bricks Discord Channel</a>.</p>
<h3>18 Handpicked Best Amazon Canada LEGO Deals &amp; Sales List for Tonight, November 10, 2026</h3>
<ul>
<li>22% off &#8211; <a href="https://www.amazon.ca/LEGO-Icons-Road-Bike-Realistic/dp/B0G2T4HQ1L?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkId=fdf5aaf6fcfcafa729d0c1798f27e450&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">18+ LEGO Icons Road Bike 11380</a> <strong>$139.99</strong> (reg.$179.99)</li>
<li>19% off &#8211; <a href="https://www.amazon.ca/LEGO-6585702-TBD-Ninjago-71872/dp/B0G2T2MW6K?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkId=983c8c10ebc2627d348de28a10442874&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO NINJAGO Ultra Dragon Battle 71872</a> <strong>$219.99</strong> (reg.$269.99)</li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-108473 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Ninjago-71872-Ultra-Dragon-Battle-August-2026-Front-Box.png" alt="" width="846" height="851" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Ninjago-71872-Ultra-Dragon-Battle-August-2026-Front-Box.png 846w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Ninjago-71872-Ultra-Dragon-Battle-August-2026-Front-Box-298x300.png 298w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Ninjago-71872-Ultra-Dragon-Battle-August-2026-Front-Box-150x150.png 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Ninjago-71872-Ultra-Dragon-Battle-August-2026-Front-Box-768x773.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 846px) 100vw, 846px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-108474 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Ninjago-71872-Ultra-Dragon-Battle-August-2026-Back-Box.png" alt="" width="883" height="892" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Ninjago-71872-Ultra-Dragon-Battle-August-2026-Back-Box.png 1781w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Ninjago-71872-Ultra-Dragon-Battle-August-2026-Back-Box-297x300.png 297w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Ninjago-71872-Ultra-Dragon-Battle-August-2026-Back-Box-1013x1024.png 1013w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Ninjago-71872-Ultra-Dragon-Battle-August-2026-Back-Box-768x776.png 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Ninjago-71872-Ultra-Dragon-Battle-August-2026-Back-Box-1520x1536.png 1520w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 883px) 100vw, 883px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-107764 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/18-LEGO-Icons-11380-Road-Bike-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png" alt="" width="1200" height="1200" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/18-LEGO-Icons-11380-Road-Bike-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/18-LEGO-Icons-11380-Road-Bike-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x300.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/18-LEGO-Icons-11380-Road-Bike-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/18-LEGO-Icons-11380-Road-Bike-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-150x150.png 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/18-LEGO-Icons-11380-Road-Bike-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x768.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-107763 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/18-LEGO-Icons-11380-Road-Bike-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.png" alt="" width="1200" height="1075" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/18-LEGO-Icons-11380-Road-Bike-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/18-LEGO-Icons-11380-Road-Bike-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-300x269.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/18-LEGO-Icons-11380-Road-Bike-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-1024x917.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/18-LEGO-Icons-11380-Road-Bike-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-768x688.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></p>
<ul>
<li>20% off &#8211; <a href="https://www.amazon.ca/LEGO-Floating-Otters-Building-Adults/dp/B0FMYTRCQT?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkId=c15a1aced37271f680c72b4fe2a01192&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">18+ LEGO Ideas Floating Sea Otters 21366</a> <strong>$119.99</strong> (reg.$149.99)</li>
<li>18% off &#8211; <a href="https://www.amazon.ca/LEGO-Downtown-Streetcar-Station-Minifigures/dp/B0CV25TPPZ?th=1&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=toysnbricks-20&amp;linkId=98e19fc7e1bfd5e1af7c058c610ee02d&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO City Downtown Streetcar and Station Train 60423</a><strong> $98.93</strong> (reg.$119.99) &#8211;<em> Listed as sold out on <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Canada</a> </em></li>
