		<item>
		<title>[Australia] Black Friday 2026 Deals for LEGOLAND Discovery Centre Melbourne, SEA LIFE, and Australia Merlin Annual Pass Now Live</title>
		<link>https://www.toysnbricks.com/australia-black-friday-2026-deals-for-legoland-discovery-centre-melbourne-sea-life-and-merlin-annual-pass-now-live/</link>
