					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="1227" height="817" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Discovery-Centre-Melbourne-Australia-Black-Friday-November-2026-Sales-Deals.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="LEGOLAND Discovery Centre Melbourne, Australia Black Friday November 2026 Sales &amp; Deals" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Discovery-Centre-Melbourne-Australia-Black-Friday-November-2026-Sales-Deals.jpg 1227w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Discovery-Centre-Melbourne-Australia-Black-Friday-November-2026-Sales-Deals-300x200.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Discovery-Centre-Melbourne-Australia-Black-Friday-November-2026-Sales-Deals-1024x682.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Discovery-Centre-Melbourne-Australia-Black-Friday-November-2026-Sales-Deals-768x511.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1227px) 100vw, 1227px" /></p>
<p>With Black Friday only a few short weeks away, LEGOLAND Discovery Centre Melbourne has gone live with its</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/australia-black-friday-2026-deals-for-legoland-discovery-centre-melbourne-sea-life-and-merlin-annual-pass-now-live/">[Australia] Black Friday 2026 Deals for LEGOLAND Discovery Centre Melbourne, SEA LIFE, and Australia Merlin Annual Pass Now Live</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>With Black Friday only a few short weeks away, <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1110lwzRk" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND Discovery Centre Melbourne</a> has gone live with its Black Friday 2026 deal. For a limited time, you can buy an Unlimited Play Annual Pass, or give someone a LEGOLAND Discovery Centre Annual Pass Gift Voucher, for only $49 AUD per person.</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Buy Tickets, Annual Passes &amp; Annual Passes at Official Merlin Australia Sites:</strong> <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1110lwzRk" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND Melbourne</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1110lwzRA" target="_blank" rel="noopener">SEA Life Melbourne Aquarium</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1110lwzRC" target="_blank" rel="noopener">SEA Life Sydney Aquarium</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1110lwzRE" target="_blank" rel="noopener">WILD LIFE Sydney Zoo</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-114580 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Discovery-Centre-Melbourne-Australia-Black-Friday-November-2026-Sales-Deals.jpg" alt="" width="1227" height="817" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Discovery-Centre-Melbourne-Australia-Black-Friday-November-2026-Sales-Deals.jpg 1227w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Discovery-Centre-Melbourne-Australia-Black-Friday-November-2026-Sales-Deals-300x200.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Discovery-Centre-Melbourne-Australia-Black-Friday-November-2026-Sales-Deals-1024x682.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGOLAND-Discovery-Centre-Melbourne-Australia-Black-Friday-November-2026-Sales-Deals-768x511.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1227px) 100vw, 1227px" /></p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-114565" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/ldc-kingdom-quest-2.webp" alt="" width="1000" height="1000" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/ldc-kingdom-quest-2.webp 1000w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/ldc-kingdom-quest-2-300x300.webp 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/ldc-kingdom-quest-2-150x150.webp 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/ldc-kingdom-quest-2-768x768.webp 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px" /></p>
<p>This is a discount of more than 25% from the standard price of $69 AUD. In addition to getting unlimited entry for a year, the Annual Pass also comes with 20% off in the Cafe, a 15% discount on birthday parties, a 10% discount in the LEGO Shop, and access to deals and exclusive benefits. The sale ends on November 30th.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-114564 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/ldc-factory-tour.webp" alt="" width="1000" height="1000" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/ldc-factory-tour.webp 1000w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/ldc-factory-tour-300x300.webp 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/ldc-factory-tour-150x150.webp 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/ldc-factory-tour-768x768.webp 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px" /></p>
<p>In addition to Black Friday deals, <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1110lwzRk" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND Discovery Centre Melbourne</a> also offers a special discount of 25% off on general admission tickets when you book for 10 or more people.  Also, when you buy your admission ticket online, you can add a SEA LIFE Melbourne ticket and save 30% compared to if you bought the tickets separately.</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Buy Tickets, Annual Passes &amp; Annual Passes at Official Merlin Australia Sites:</strong> <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1110lwzRk" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND Melbourne</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1110lwzRA" target="_blank" rel="noopener">SEA Life Melbourne Aquarium</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1110lwzRC" target="_blank" rel="noopener">SEA Life Sydney Aquarium</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1110lwzRE" target="_blank" rel="noopener">WILD LIFE Sydney Zoo</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-114566" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/ldc-mcg.webp" alt="" width="1000" height="1000" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/ldc-mcg.webp 1000w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/ldc-mcg-300x300.webp 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/ldc-mcg-150x150.webp 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/ldc-mcg-768x768.webp 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px" /></p>
<p>Speaking of SEA LIFE Melbourne, it and SEA LIFE Sydney just revealed their Black Friday deals, as well. During the sale, which ends on December 1st, 2026, you can get a SEA LIFE Melbourne or SEA LIFE Sydney Annual Pass or Annual Pass Gift Voucher for $79 AUD per person, instead of the standard price of $99 AUD. As a Black Friday special, you can also get one FREE Bring a Friend voucher with every pass.</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Buy Tickets, Annual Passes &amp; Annual Passes at Official Merlin Australia Sites:</strong> <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1110lwzRk" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND Melbourne</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1110lwzRA" target="_blank" rel="noopener">SEA Life Melbourne Aquarium</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1110lwzRC" target="_blank" rel="noopener">SEA Life Sydney Aquarium</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1110lwzRE" target="_blank" rel="noopener">WILD LIFE Sydney Zoo</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-114567" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/jellyfish_children.webp" alt="" width="840" height="560" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/jellyfish_children.webp 840w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/jellyfish_children-300x200.webp 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/jellyfish_children-768x512.webp 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 840px) 100vw, 840px" /></p>
<p>But if you want access to not just LEGOLAND and/or SEA LIFE, but a collection of other attractions throughout Australia and New Zealand, a Merlin Annual Pass may be for you. This pass gives you 12 months of unlimited and unrestricted access to eight attractions, including:</p>
<ul>
<li>LEGOLAND Discovery Centre Melbourne</li>
<li>SEA LIFE Melbourne Aquarium</li>
<li>SEA LIFE Sydney Aquarium</li>
<li>SEA LIFE Sunshine Coast</li>
<li>SEA LIFE Kelly Tarlton&#8217;s</li>
<li>WILD LIFE Sydney Zoo</li>
<li>Sydney Tower Eye</li>
<li>Madame Tussauds Sydney</li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-114579 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/SEALIFE-Aquarium-Sydney-Australia-Black-Friday-2026-Deals.jpg" alt="" width="1344" height="583" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/SEALIFE-Aquarium-Sydney-Australia-Black-Friday-2026-Deals.jpg 1832w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/SEALIFE-Aquarium-Sydney-Australia-Black-Friday-2026-Deals-300x130.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/SEALIFE-Aquarium-Sydney-Australia-Black-Friday-2026-Deals-1024x444.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/SEALIFE-Aquarium-Sydney-Australia-Black-Friday-2026-Deals-768x333.jpg 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/SEALIFE-Aquarium-Sydney-Australia-Black-Friday-2026-Deals-1536x667.jpg 1536w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1344px) 100vw, 1344px" /></p>
<p>This Black Friday season, you can pick up a Merlin Annual Pass for only $99 AUD per person, as opposed to the regular price of $119 AUD per person. While pre-booking is needed for all attractions, there are no blackout periods, and the pass also comes with a range of exclusive benefits and deals.</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Buy Tickets, Annual Passes &amp; Annual Passes at Official Merlin Australia Sites:</strong> <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1110lwzRk" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND Melbourne</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1110lwzRA" target="_blank" rel="noopener">SEA Life Melbourne Aquarium</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1110lwzRC" target="_blank" rel="noopener">SEA Life Sydney Aquarium</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1110lwzRE" target="_blank" rel="noopener">WILD LIFE Sydney Zoo</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-114568" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/00002_slsa_rockpool-ranger-2025_-use-global-_-exp-inperp-_mum-and-son-with-aquarist.webp" alt="" width="1920" height="768" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/00002_slsa_rockpool-ranger-2025_-use-global-_-exp-inperp-_mum-and-son-with-aquarist.webp 1920w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/00002_slsa_rockpool-ranger-2025_-use-global-_-exp-inperp-_mum-and-son-with-aquarist-300x120.webp 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/00002_slsa_rockpool-ranger-2025_-use-global-_-exp-inperp-_mum-and-son-with-aquarist-1024x410.webp 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/00002_slsa_rockpool-ranger-2025_-use-global-_-exp-inperp-_mum-and-son-with-aquarist-768x307.webp 768w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/00002_slsa_rockpool-ranger-2025_-use-global-_-exp-inperp-_mum-and-son-with-aquarist-1536x614.webp 1536w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1920px) 100vw, 1920px" /></p>
<p>So whether you just want to visit LEGOLAND Discovery Centre Melbourne alone, or pair it with entry to a variety of other attractions throughout Australia and New Zealand, there&#8217;s certainly a Black Friday deal out there to help you save money on your next adventure!</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Buy Tickets, Annual Passes &amp; Merlin Annual Passes at Official Australia Sites:</strong> <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1110lwzRk" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND Melbourne</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1110lwzRA" target="_blank" rel="noopener">SEA Life Melbourne Aquarium</a> | <a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1110lwzRC" target="_blank" rel="noopener">SEA Life Sydney Aquarium</a></li>
</ul>
<p><em><strong>Looking to get car rentals, flights or vacation packages to get to Australia?</strong> These reputable official travel sites allow you to purchase what you need:</em> <a href="https://expedia.com/affiliates/expedia-home.GpHMNqi" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Expedia</a> | <a href="https://booking.stay22.com/toysnbricks/CCGw6vqmUn" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Booking.com</a> | <a href="https://tripadvisor.stay22.com/toysnbricks/muM7xHVAH4" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">TripAdvisor</a></p>
<p><a href="https://expedia.com/affiliates/expedia-home.GpHMNqi" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-109347 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Expedia-Travel-Banner-Logo-Leaderboard-728x90-Ad-3.jpg" alt="" width="907" height="108" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Expedia-Travel-Banner-Logo-Leaderboard-728x90-Ad-3.jpg 907w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Expedia-Travel-Banner-Logo-Leaderboard-728x90-Ad-3-300x36.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Expedia-Travel-Banner-Logo-Leaderboard-728x90-Ad-3-768x91.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 907px) 100vw, 907px" /></a></p>
<p>Below are other quick links for LEGOLAND Theme Parks Resorts.</p>
<h3>Official Discount Landing Pages for Worldwide LEGOLAND Theme Parks</h3>
<p><strong>For the most up to date current LEGOLAND Theme Parks sales &amp; deals, check the official LEGOLAND Theme Parks promotional pages links below. </strong></p>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXL/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fcalifornia%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>California, US</strong> &#8211; LEGOLAND Theme Park Sales &amp; Deals Promotional Page</a></li>
<li><a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXM/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fflorida%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>Florida, US</strong> &#8211; LEGOLAND Theme Park Sales &amp; Deals Promotional Page</a></li>
<li><a href="https://merlin.prf.hn/click/camref:1100l5xoXG/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.com%2Fnew-york%2Fdeals%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>New York, US</strong> &#8211; LEGOLAND Theme Park Sales &amp; Deals Promotional Page</a></li>
<li><a href="https://prf.hn/click/camref:1101l5CLqa/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.co.uk%2Foffers%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>United Kingdom</strong> &#8211; LEGOLAND Theme Park Sales &amp; Deals Promotional Page</a></li>
<li><a href="https://merlinrteu.prf.hn/click/camref:1101l5CLqo/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.dk%2Fen%2Foffers%2F%3F" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>Denmark</strong> &#8211; LEGOLAND Theme Park Sales &amp; Deals Promotional Page</a></li>
<li><a href="https://merlinrteu.prf.hn/click/camref:1101l5CLqp/destination:https%3A%2F%2Fwww.legoland.de%2Fen%2Foffers%2F" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>Germany</strong> &#8211; LEGOLAND Theme Park Sales &amp; Deals Promotional Page</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-103542 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Sales-Deals-Logo-Banner-Discount-Savings.jpg" alt="" width="909" height="459" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Sales-Deals-Logo-Banner-Discount-Savings.jpg 909w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Sales-Deals-Logo-Banner-Discount-Savings-300x151.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Sales-Deals-Logo-Banner-Discount-Savings-768x388.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 909px) 100vw, 909px" /></p>
<h3>Buy LEGO Discovery Center Tickets Around the World</h3>
<ul>
