					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="817" height="783" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/LEGO-40820-Up-Scaled-Santa-Minifigure-October-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-Christmas-2025-Set.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="LEGO 40820 Up-Scaled Santa Minifigure October 2025 Release Date Front Box - Christmas 2025 Set" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/LEGO-40820-Up-Scaled-Santa-Minifigure-October-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-Christmas-2025-Set.jpg 817w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/LEGO-40820-Up-Scaled-Santa-Minifigure-October-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-Christmas-2025-Set-300x288.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/LEGO-40820-Up-Scaled-Santa-Minifigure-October-2025-Release-Date-Front-Box-Christmas-2025-Set-768x736.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 817px) 100vw, 817px" /></p>
<p>Good Afternoon LEGO Fans &#8211; Happy Tuesday! Amazon US currently has some LEGO deals for today. Free shipping</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/6-handpicked-best-amazon-us-lego-deals-sales-list-for-this-afternoon-november-10-2026/">6 Handpicked Best Amazon US LEGO Deals &#038; Sales List for This Afternoon, November 10, 2026</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Good Afternoon LEGO Fans &#8211; Happy Tuesday! <a href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19">Amazon US</a> currently has some LEGO deals for today. Free shipping on orders above $35. As always, prices can fluctuate at anytime.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-99922 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/LEGO-40820-Up-Scaled-Santa-Minifigure-October-2025-Release-Date-Lifestyle-2-Christmas-2025-Set.jpg" alt="" width="992" height="741" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/LEGO-40820-Up-Scaled-Santa-Minifigure-October-2025-Release-Date-Lifestyle-2-Christmas-2025-Set.jpg 992w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/LEGO-40820-Up-Scaled-Santa-Minifigure-October-2025-Release-Date-Lifestyle-2-Christmas-2025-Set-300x224.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/LEGO-40820-Up-Scaled-Santa-Minifigure-October-2025-Release-Date-Lifestyle-2-Christmas-2025-Set-768x574.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 992px) 100vw, 992px" /></p>
<p>My favorite top deal of the day would be <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Up-Scaled-Minifigure-Christmas-Decoration/dp/B0G2T5PP7W?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=14963109d84d9f2cea8f46dcdda785d5&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Up-Scaled Santa Minifigure 40820</a> at 30% off for <strong>$41.99</strong> (reg.$59.99). A great set for Christmas and at 30% off (currently classified as an Early Black Friday Deal on Amazon), you can&#8217;t go wrong with it. Another top pick would be the <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Disney-Stitch-Beach-House/dp/B0DJ1BLDC4?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=424ca8e39e01a1f1592f7e002e915b63&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Disney Lilo and Stitch Beach House 43268</a> at 31% off for <strong>$62.03</strong> (reg.$89.99).</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-93774 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/LEGO-Disney-43268-Lilo-and-Stitch-Beach-House-March-2025-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="1056" height="981" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/LEGO-Disney-43268-Lilo-and-Stitch-Beach-House-March-2025-Front-Box.jpg 1400w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/LEGO-Disney-43268-Lilo-and-Stitch-Beach-House-March-2025-Front-Box-300x279.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/LEGO-Disney-43268-Lilo-and-Stitch-Beach-House-March-2025-Front-Box-1024x951.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/LEGO-Disney-43268-Lilo-and-Stitch-Beach-House-March-2025-Front-Box-768x713.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1056px) 100vw, 1056px" /></p>
<p>Below are 6 of our Handpicked Best Amazon US LEGO Deals &amp; Sales List for Today, November 10, 2026. Be sure to subscribe to our email so you don’t miss out on any other LEGO Sales &amp; Deals happening in the USA!</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
