<p>A few of my favorites from the list are the Fortnite Battle Bus, as it comes with many mini figures you can fill the bus with, and the Japanese Cherry Blossom Landscape, as it looks brilliant as a 3D art piece on your wall. The sheer attention to detail and authenticity of the Notre-Dame de Paris piece also make it stand out as one of the best choices, especially for architecture and history lovers.</p>
<p>For more <strong>LEGO Sales Finds submitted by Toys N Bricks forum members</strong>, you can <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/forum/index.php?/forum/17-general-lego-sales-deals-forum-members-only/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">visit our LEGO Sales &amp; Deals forum section</a>. Registration for a forum membership account is<strong> free and fast</strong>.</p>
