										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>LEGO currently has a selection of exciting sets for sale on <a href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://amzn.to/2KaJa19">Amazon US</a>, and here are some of the best.</p>
<p><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get a choice of daily LEGO News, LEGO Sales &amp; Deals or All Updates right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates.</p>
<p>1. <span class="a-size-large product-title-word-break">LEGO Creator 3 in 1 Wild Animals Panda Family </span><span id="productTitle" class="a-size-large product-title-word-break">31165 </span><span id="productTitle" class="a-size-large product-title-word-break"></span>&#8211; 20<span style="font-weight: 400;">% off (Regular $39.99, on sale for $31.95).</span></p>
